  "notes": [
    "Multi-channel and single-channel signed distance field generation for the font backend (Docs/Design/Font/06-TextLayoutCore.ko.md section 6.5, 08-ThirdParty.ko.md section 8.2). ext/import-font reads FreeType outlines into msdfgen::Shape (the same path as UE 5.8 SlateSdfGenerator, MSDFGEN_USE_FREETYPE); the other ext helpers (SVG import, PNG saving, geometry resolution through Skia) are not imported.",
    "msdfgen::Shape holds std::vector; the engine adapter (TextLayoutBackend) uses it through msdfgen members only and writes no std names, so the engine STL policy needs no exception. No RTTI and no exceptions.",
    "RocksApproximateSdf.cpp (glue) adds approximateSDF, the fast distance field approximation UE 5.8 SlateSdfGenerator uses for placeholders and the SdfApproximation mode. It is adapted from upstream branch performance-optimization, commit 3af96cda22c2eee039a41ccef67adfdb2188d469, core/approximate-sdf.cpp (same author and MIT license); 1.13.1 lacks verticalScanlineIntersections, so the vertical pass runs scanlineIntersections on a transposed shape copy. Glue has no header; TextLayoutBackend declares the function. Docs/Design/Font/08-ThirdParty.ko.md section 8.2."
  ],
